@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080

### 1) Get users and pick an existing id
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/users

### 2) Get teams and pick an existing id
GET {{baseUrl}}/team/all

### 3) Get matches for tournament 1 (adjust tournament id if needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matchs/1

### Register team/user to a match
### IDs are provided via query params
POST {{baseUrl}}/inscriptionMatches?match=1&team.id=1&user.id=1


